WEBVTT

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:11.220
The history of gaming extends 5,000 
years into the past to ancient Egypt.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:15.720
Ancient games foretold the 
futures of men and kings.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:19.200
They were magic ceremonies that 
determined a person's fate.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.340
These ceremonies were known 
as the "Shadow Games."

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.990
In the present, a young boy 
solves the Millennium Puzzle.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:30.210
He becomes the heir to the Shadow Games.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:38.300
This boy possesses two hearts - 
one of light and one of darkness.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:42.210
He is known as "Yu-Gi-Oh."

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:50.340
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:57.250
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:04.000
Game cartridges are stacked 
in the corner of the room

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:10.700
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:15.800
You're on the other side of the table

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:19.170
I'm talking to you, but...

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:26.100
You don't change your 
facial expression at all

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:32.350
Even though I'm this close to you

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:39.620
These feelings don't reach 
you, don't reach you

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:46.360
What is truly precious?

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:57.450
No matter what card you play, it's 
powerless against my Insect army.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:00.070
Go, Basic Insect Laser Cannon!

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:01.980
Attack!

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:07.170
Haga, you said "attack."

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:08.490
What?

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:15.170
Since you declared an attack, it acted as a 
switch to activate my trap card Mirror Force.

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:17.020
Don't shoot!

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:27.100
My Insect army...

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:31.100
All right!

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:32.290
Yugi!

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:36.720
To put it simply: Haga, you have no skills.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:42.980
Perfectly Ultimate Great Moth

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:49.970
Yeah!  How's that, bug boy?

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:52.420
You'll never defeat Yugi!

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:55.540
Go, Yugi!  You'll beat him easily!

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:58.260
We'll see about that.

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:02.490
Lil' Yugi only has a slight lead.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:07.000
Duel Monsters is a game where you don't 
know what the next turn will bring.

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:08.810
It's too early to celebrate.

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:11.200
She's so arrogant!

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.650
And she calls him "Lil' Yugi?"

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:16.850
Whatever!  Yugi's in the lead!

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:19.780
Insector Haga is the Japan champion.

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:22.210
The real battle is only getting started.

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:25.970
Anzu, I agree with Mai.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.390
Me too.

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:30.210
Whose side are you on?

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:34.090
I'm sure Yugi will win, but 
he can't let his guard down.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:36.180
I agree.

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:40.020
He'll have to duel her eventually.

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:45.020
Yugi, show me how skilled you are.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:50.690
Yugi, you'll regret the fact that 
I'm now taking this duel seriously.

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:53.800
Put your frustrations into 
your cards and attack me.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.680
I'll face you head-on and defeat you.

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:57.880
Stop acting tough.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:01.760
My Insect deck contains 
the ultimate trump card.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:04.980
If I play the card, I'll definitely win.

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:10.020
Yugi, your life as a duelist is already over!

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:16.900
Aww, this card doesn't stand a 
chance against your set card.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:23.740
Attack me, Yugi.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:26.730
You can't reel me in that easily.

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:30.340
Because his trap card is still active.

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:34.970
I'll set this mystery card on the field.

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:39.790
If I declare an attack, all 
my monsters will be destroyed.

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:46.500
If my two cards, including Dark Magician, 
are destroyed, I'll lose a lot of life points.

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:51.700
How can I take the least amount of 
risk and still destroy his trap card?

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:54.070
I'll play this card!

00:04:55.570 --> 00:05:00.650
Monster Recovery calls back 
all my monsters on the field.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.300
Monsters, turn back into cards!

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:07.140
I didn't think of that.

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:14.260
I return all the cards on the field and 
in my hand to my deck and shuffle them.

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:21.060
I draw five new cards and play the 
card with the fewest attack points.

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:22.860
In attack position!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:35.260
Now your trap card is gone.

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:37.820
I end my turn.

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:44.820
Everything's going just as I planned.

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:45.930
What?

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:50.380
I'll show you the card that I played earlier!

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:58.490
Larvae Moth.  It has low 
attack and defense points.

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:00.860
Is Haga planning a combo?

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:04.570
This is my trump card!

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:06.280
Cocoon of Evolution!

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:07.480
What?

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:09.860
Merge with Larvae Moth!

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:19.450
What is that?

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:21.850
His bug is wrapped in a cocoon.

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:25.430
Insector Haga is finally 
showing his true abilities.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:34.700
Larvae Moth will transform 
inside the Cocoon every turn.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:38.780
In five turns, it will transform 
into Perfectly Ultimate Great Moth!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:43.010
When it does, nothing can defeat Great Moth!

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:45.830
Perfectly Ultimate Great Moth?

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:49.230
The Field Power Source gives 
my Cocoon more defense points.

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:52.570
There aren't many monsters whose attack 
points are greater than

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:53.970
this Cocoon's defense points.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:58.100
Your cards' attack points 
won't even leave a dent.

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:00.860
Five turns, Yugi.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:05.250
In five turns, Perfectly Ultimate 
Great Moth will defeat you.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:10.080
This is bad.  If it evolves into 
its ultimate stage, I can't win.

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:13.620
I have to destroy the Cocoon before then.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:21.380
Gaia The Fierce Knight, attack the Cocoon!

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:29.930
Spiral Shaver!

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:34.530
It repelled Gaia's attack?

00:07:34.690 --> 00:07:37.110
You're wasting your time.

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:42.040
It's no good.  The Field Power Source 
gives the Cocoon too many defense points.

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:46.580
If I keep attacking carelessly, 
I'll run out of life points.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:47.890
Yugi.

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:50.660
Why are you struggling against a cocoon?

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:53.480
What's so funny?

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:56.090
You guys don't know anything.

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:58.810
It's only natural that Lil' 
Yugi is having a hard time.

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:00.830
Stop calling him "Lil' Yugi!"

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.690
What do you mean?

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:08.200
Unfortunately, no one has ever beaten 
the Cocoon of Evolution combo.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:09.790
What?

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:12.700
Are you saying that Yugi is going to lose?

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:15.570
What will you do, Yugi?

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:20.290
Give up.  Your cards aren't good 
enough to scratch my Cocoon.

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:25.320
Even if I try a combo, I don't have the 
cards to overcome the Cocoon's defense points.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.020
What should I do?

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:30.680
When Cocoon of Evolution is on the field,

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:35.330
I can't play any other cards until 
it reaches its ultimate stage.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:42.500
I'll end my turn quietly, but the monster 
inside the Cocoon continues to evolve.

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:49.380
I'll play this card for now 
to strengthen my defense.

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:53.130
Avoiding confrontation again?

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:56.380
Didn't you say were going to 
face me head-on and defeat me?

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:04.520
This isn't good.  I'm wasting turns 
without coming up with a next move.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:09.140
In two turns, Perfectly Ultimate 
Great Moth will be born.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:12.060
I've won this duel.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:15.410
Don't lose, Yugi!

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:18.740
I won't forgive you if you lose!

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:20.110
But what can I do?

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:24.250
I don't want to watch you lose, Yugi!

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:26.610
Get fired up!

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:29.280
Fire...  That's it!

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:33.770
When a game begins, a duelist 
can only trust himself.

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:38.460
Your lame cheers don't help at all.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.290
It does help!

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:42.950
Our hearts will reach Yugi!

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.610
And Yugi will definitely win!

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:48.940
You're all naïve.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:52.690
Yeah!

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:53.820
Yugi!

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:59.220
I told you so!  A pheromone-filled hussy 
like you could never understand our friendship.

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:03.180
Did he find a strategy to 
break out of this situation?

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:07.320
Here I go!  Curse of Dragon!

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:12.740
Combo attack!

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.020
Go!  Hell Flame!

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:22.020
I said it's a waste of time!

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:25.380
It doesn't have enough attack 
points to damage my Cocoon!

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:28.050
What's so funny?

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:30.440
Who said I'm attacking your Cocoon?

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:37.100
I attacked the forest.

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:41.770
No way!  You burned the entire forest field!

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:45.790
Now Cocoon of Evolution lost 
the forest's Field Power.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.900
Its defense points decrease.

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:55.220
Gaia The Fierce Knight!  Spiral Shaver!

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:59.410
Cocoon of Evolution is destroyed!

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:00.610
He did it!

00:11:00.610 --> 00:11:03.260
He destroyed Cocoon of Evolution!

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:11.520
What's making that noise?

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:34.900
What's making that noise?

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:36.460
No way!

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:48.390
A monster came out of the Cocoon!

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:51.050
Is this the rumored...

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:53.370
Here it comes!

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:56.940
This is Great Moth, the 
fourth stage of evolution!

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:01.300
That's Great Moth?

00:12:02.810 --> 00:12:07.170
It may not have reached its ultimate stage, 
but it's strong enough to defeat you.

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:08.340
Yugi!

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:10.420
I've never seen it before.

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:14.520
This is Great Moth, Insector 
Haga's true trump card.

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:17.370
Haga now has an overwhelming advantage.

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:19.690
You're in a tight spot, Yugi.

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:24.690
I managed to stop it from reaching 
its ultimate stage, but...

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:28.600
What happened to your momentum, Yugi?

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:32.200
Has Great Moth left you speechless?

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:39.960
I've been thinking of 
how to defeat that pest.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.760
Go ahead and try!

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:42.980
Let's battle!

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:44.010
Yeah!

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:45.170
It's my turn!

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:47.140
Fly, Great Moth!

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:52.500
Haga, you're going to attack from the sky?

00:12:54.370 --> 00:13:02.010
Among Yugi's monsters, only Curse of Dragon 
can attack Great Moth when it's flying.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:06.000
And none of them can match 
Great Moth's attack points.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:10.570
On the next turn, I'll destroy that 
earthbound Gaia The Fierce Knight.

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:13.290
That's bad!  Gaia is the key to my attack!

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:15.510
Without it, I'll definitely lose!

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:17.520
Give up, Yugi.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:23.520
Your Gaia is helpless against 
my flying Great Moth.

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:26.220
I'm counting on this card!

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:30.160
It doesn't matter what card you play!

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:32.060
Moth Hurricane!

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:36.730
Beaver Warrior...

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:38.520
It's working!

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:44.240
Its gigantic wings create a gale 
that instantly pulverizes all creatures on the ground!

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:49.740
I vanquished Gaia The Fierce Knight!

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:51.240
Are you sure?

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:56.750
Haga, you don't understand the 
effect of the card that I played.

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:58.750
What's that?

00:14:03.810 --> 00:14:05.760
Gaia the Dragon Champion!

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:08.930
Polymerization combined 
two monsters into one.

00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:13.060
You combined Gaia and Curse of Dragon?

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:15.840
By combining, Gaia's power increased.

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:18.360
It now has the same number of 
attack points as Great Moth.

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:21.440
This battle in the sky should be interesting.

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:26.210
Its attack points increased?  
We'll see about that!

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:27.220
What?

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.100
Dragon Champion's body is...

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:36.690
But why?

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:44.700
I see.  Poisonous pollen.

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:46.970
You finally noticed.

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:52.270
Great Moth's Moth Hurricane 
not only blows away

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:55.730
all land monsters, but its 
pollen poisons them as well.

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:59.250
If you don't do something fast,

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:02.330
Gaia the Dragon Champion's attack 
points will keep decaying.

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:06.770
This is bad.  If it loses more attack points

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:10.970
and Great Moth attacks it, 
I'll lose all my life points.

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:16.130
In that case, I have to play this card!

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.000
Makiu, the Magical Mist!

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:19.740
What?

00:15:19.740 --> 00:15:22.030
There's fog in the Duel Ring?

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:27.670
That's right.  Makiu envelops 
all monsters in mist.

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:32.490
I see.  The moisture washes 
away the poisonous pollen.

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:36.620
Now my Dragon Champion won't 
lose any more attack points.

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:43.210
Yugi, this is the best strategy 
your lame brain can come up with?

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:46.350
Great Moth will destroy 
Gaia the Dragon Champion

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:49.090
with an attack that's more 
powerful than the poison!

00:15:50.850 --> 00:15:54.620
Go!  Great Moth's ultimate attack!

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.610
Moth Burning Death Tornado!

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:03.340
Gaia the Dragon Champion is destroyed!

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:08.540
Your life points are like 
a candle in the wind, Yugi!

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:15.370
Hang in there, Yugi!  Do something!

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.890
This battle's over.

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:19.810
That's not true!  Yugi will win!

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:21.770
I won't give up hope.

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:26.410
It's impossible.  There's 
no way to turn the tables.

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:31.770
You can't win a duel with friendship or hope.

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:36.650
You don't know anything about 
our friendship with Yugi!

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:39.410
Tell her, Jonouchi!

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:41.930
Yugi is fine.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:43.370
In order to win...

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:44.800
There's a way, right?

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:49.140
There is.  But I don't know how because 
I only finished 8th in the regionals.

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.490
Jonouchi!

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:55.430
Lil' Yugi fought well 
against the Japan champion.

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:58.580
He shouldn't feel ashamed in this duel.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.610
His opponent was just too strong for him.

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:02.230
Wrong, Lil' Mai.

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:04.220
Lil' Mai?

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:07.180
Your assumption is wrong.

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:10.420
Look at Yugi!

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.930
Yugi is laughing.

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:17.300
Why?

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:25.170
Why are you laughing?  What's so funny?

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:30.220
Haga, when are you happiest as a duelist?

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:40.040
You're happiest when a duel goes exactly as 
planned, and victory is guaranteed, right?

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:42.050
What are you trying to say?

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:45.210
Haga, you fell for my strategy.

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:48.530
Gaia the Dragon Champion 
was a ruse from the start.

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:50.570
Dragon Champion was a ruse?

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:51.960
It's my turn!

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:55.250
I attack Great Moth with this card!

00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:05.730
Summoned Skull!

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:07.730
No way!

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:15.370
Stop trying to scare me.

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:19.090
Summoned Skull has fewer attack 
points than my Great Moth.

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:23.750
If it attacks, Yugi's life points 
will fall to 0, and I win.

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:28.020
If he attacks with that card, it's suicide.

00:18:28.610 --> 00:18:34.780
Haga, you still don't understand 
why I played Makiu?

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:46.310
Oh no!   Makiu soaked Great 
Moth's body in water!

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:47.940
You finally noticed.

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:53.080
Makiu was setting up my Summoned 
Skull's electric attack.

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:57.090
Makiu makes Great Moth more 
vulnerable to electricity,

00:18:57.090 --> 00:18:59.290
raising Summoned Skull's attack points.

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:03.170
Go, Summoned Skull!

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:04.780
Magic Lightning!

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:23.910
Great Moth is destroyed!

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:30.420
My Great Moth!

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:34.420
All right!

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:37.540
Hooray!  Yugi won!

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:43.340
So this is how Yugi, the 
boy who beat Kaiba, duels.

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:50.780
This can't be happening!

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:53.790
Who'd have thought that the first 
duelist to lose all his Star Chips

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.440
would be the Japan champion.

00:19:55.690 --> 00:19:57.160
You know the rules.

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:59.720
I'll take both your Star Chips.

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:00.240
Now-

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:05.630
Now get off this island, 
you weak little insect!

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:09.060
I'll also take your glove.

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:17.230
I now have 3 Star Chips.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:20.300
I need 7 more to get into Pegasus's castle.

00:20:23.810 --> 00:20:26.540
Just you wait, Pegasus!

00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:37.730
Jonouchi entered this tournament so 
that he can fix his sister's eyes.

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:41.330
His first opponent is Mai Kujaku.

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:46.030
Mai uses aroma tactics to know 
what her facedown cards are.

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:49.650
She also uses combo attacks with her 
Harpie Ladies to punish Jonouchi.

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:51.000
Don't give up!

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:54.680
The clue to victory is something 
that can be seen but remains unseen.

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:57.450
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Gorgeous Harpie Lady

00:20:57.450 --> 00:20:59.500
Duel, standby!

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:11.390
The flask glistens

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:19.240
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:28.220
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:35.990
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:41.820
Shower of happiness

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:45.930
I will shower you with it

00:21:46.260 --> 00:21:54.210
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:58.450
Shower of happiness

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:02.570
You are not alone

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:09.290
You're protected by a 
giant ring of friendship
